WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
Drive Rush heavy kick punishes Ken’s recorded recovery.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.350
The medium kicks lead into the cancel-Rush extension.

3
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.650
Wild Lift launches Ken for the first raw-Rush pickup.

4
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.750
Standing light kick keeps the airborne opponent in reach.

5
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.000
A second Wild Lift launches into another light-kick pickup.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.600
The slide ends the long travelling juggle.
